  beforeCookingDialogue:
  - "Ma: Cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng... c\u0169ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\xECn th\u1EA5y ta."
  - "Ma: Ta \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EDD trong c\u0103n b\u1EBFp n\xE0y r\u1EA5t l\xE2u, ch\u1EC9
